---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | Ishraq Alam"
  description="From Bangladesh to Portsmouth: HR, BPO call centres, remote B2B telemarketing for US and Canadian companies, and now SDR at a UK care-tech SaaS company."
>
  <section>
    <div class="container narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow animate-fade-in-up">About</span>
      <h1 class="animate-fade-in-up delay-1">From Bangladesh to Portsmouth</h1>
      <p class="lede animate-fade-in-up delay-2">
        I'm Ishraq Alam. About six months ago my wife and I relocated from Bangladesh to
        Portsmouth, UK, where I work as a Sales Development Representative at Nourish
        Care, a digital care management SaaS platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        I didn't start in sales. My background is in Human Resource Management, which
        turned out to be an unexpectedly good foundation for understanding what makes
        people say yes. From there I moved into BPO call centres, then remote B2B
        telemarketing for US and Canadian companies across insurance, home improvement,
        SaaS, and IT procurement. Thousands of cold calls, C2-level English fluency, and
        a habit of noticing which parts of the process were broken.
      </p>
      <p>
        What connects HR, call centres, telemarketing, and care-tech SaaS? In every one
        of them, I ended up doing the same thing: <strong>building repeatable systems
        out of messy, manual processes</strong>. Sometimes that's a cold-calling script
        refined over hundreds of dials. Sometimes it's a live data dashboard the whole
        company ends up using.
      </p>
      <p>
        That's the through-line this site exists to show: a sales rep who builds sales
        tech, and who wants to keep doing it in a closing role.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/case-studies/" class="btn btn-primary">See what I've built</a>
        <a href="/enterprise/" class="btn btn-ghost">Enterprise &amp; B2B campaigns</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    section { padding-top: 80px; }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
  </style>
</Base>
